                                                "example_id": "9c697e79-d906-4b14-8f33-68ff32172feb",
                                                "sense_id": "146469ba-538c-33e8-b850-3d35844a37c9",
                                                "text": "'Well, it's your mother who chose Victor. I never liked the name. It sounded a bit like boasting. I think it was because you were born on May something or other when we celebrate the day Germans surrendered.' 'I wasn't. I was born in September.' 'Oh, then there must have been another reason. Perhaps she thought to have you at all was her victory. Over me. I wasn't so keen on a child.'"
                                            },
